[{"id":"n1654433177","name":"檜洞丸","lat":35.479,"lon":139.10276,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["toilets","free"],"kid":0.5,"nov":0.68,"rich":0.85,"apl":0.7,"city":"相模原市緑区","wd":"Q7483804","desc":"丹沢山地の山","wp":{"title":"檜洞丸","extract":"檜洞丸（ひのきぼらまる）は、丹沢山地西部、神奈川県相模原市と同県足柄上郡山北町の境にある標高1,601mの山である。別名、青ヶ岳（あおがたけ）。新字体で桧洞丸と表記されることもある。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Mt.Hinokiboramaru_13.jpg/960px-Mt.Hinokiboramaru_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mt.Hinokiboramaru_13.jpg","artist":"Σ64","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"t":[89]},{"id":"n6017155052","name":"臼ヶ岳","lat":35.47666,"lon":139.12654,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":0.73,"rich":0.6,"apl":0.7,"city":"山北町","wd":"Q11613207","wp":{"title":"臼ヶ岳 (神奈川県)","extract":"臼ヶ岳（うすがたけ）は、丹沢山地の丹沢主稜にある標高1,460 mの山である。山体は神奈川県相模原市緑区と足柄上郡山北町に属すが、山頂部は山北町側にある。丹沢大山国定公園に指定されている。"},"t":[89]},{"id":"n6017164567","name":"ミカゲ沢ノ頭","lat":35.48459,"lon":139.13011,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":0.73,"rich":0.85,"apl":0.7,"city":"山北町","wd":"Q11341877","wp":{"title":"ミカゲ沢ノ頭","extract":"ミカゲ沢ノ頭（みかげさわの あたま/かしら）は、丹沢山地の丹沢主稜にある標高1,421mの山である。神奈川県相模原市緑区と足柄上郡山北町との境界線上に位置し、丹沢大山国定公園に属する。 当山から蛭ヶ岳までは、丹沢の一般登山路でも屈指の急坂であり、滑落者がよく出ているので注意を要する（特に凍結時）。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Mikage-hiru_from_hanadate.JPG/960px-Mikage-hiru_from_hanadate.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mikage-hiru_from_hanadate.JPG","artist":"Σ64","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},"t":[89]},{"id":"n1654433338","name":"蛭ヶ岳","lat":35.48623,"lon":139.1388,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":0.55,"rich":0.85,"apl":0.7,"city":"相模原市緑区","wd":"Q650653","desc":"丹沢山地の山","wp":{"title":"蛭ヶ岳","extract":"蛭ヶ岳（ひるがたけ）は丹沢山地中央部にある標高1,673 mの山。丹沢山地の最高峰であり神奈川県の最高峰でもある。神奈川県相模原市緑区と足柄上郡山北町の境界線上に位置し、丹沢大山国定公園に属す。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Mt.Hirugatake_from_Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG/960px-Mt.Hirugatake_from_Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mt.Hirugatake_from_Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG","artist":"Σ64","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},"t":[89]},{"id":"n14121969337","name":"鬼ヶ岩ノ頭","lat":35.48231,"lon":139.14645,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":0.73,"rich":0.85,"apl":0.7,"city":"山北町","wd":"Q11673390","wp":{"title":"鬼ヶ岩ノ頭","extract":"鬼ヶ岩ノ頭（おにがいわの あたま/かしら）は、丹沢山地の丹沢主脈にある標高1,608mの山である。神奈川県相模原市と足柄上郡山北町との境界線上に位置し、丹沢大山国定公園に属す。 その名の通り山頂付近には鬼の角のような岩「鬼ヶ岩」がそびえ立っており、天気が良ければ鬼ヶ岩の間から雄大な蛭ヶ岳の山体を望むことができる。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG/960px-Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mt.Onigaiwanoatama01.JPG","artist":"Σ64","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},"t":[89]},{"id":"o76ab206b839142cc","name":"丹沢山地","lat":35.48667,"lon":139.13889,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":0.7,"city":"相模原市緑区","src":"Overture","t":[89]},{"id":"oc93742f151f647c5","name":"蛭ケ岳","lat":35.48638,"lon":139.13891,"cat":"view","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.45,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":0.7,"city":"相模原市緑区","src":"Overture","t":[89]},{"id":"o8f64e97df88e435c","name":"ユーシンロッジ","lat":35.45157,"lon":139.12136,"cat":"nature","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.65,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":1,"city":"山北町","src":"Overture","t":[76]}]